[ti:Let My Love Be]
[ar:Allen Parvin]
[al:Carry the Light]
[length:04:09.91]
[re:AINEO Music]
[ve:1.0]

[00:16.60]Lord, You gave these hands for serving,
[00:22.00]These words to heal, these feet to go.
[00:28.20]Help me love the ones You've given,
[00:33.20]More than they will ever know.
[00:37.20]When I'm weary, make me patient.
[00:43.40]When I'm hurried, slow my pace.
[00:48.70]Let my life reflect Your kindness,
[00:55.90]Filled with mercy, truth, and grace.

[01:08.40]Let my love be patient.
[01:12.50]Let my love be kind.
[01:16.80]Let it always seek another
[01:24.80]Long before it seeketh mine.
[01:30.20]Let my love bring hope to hurting.
[01:36.20]Let my love speak truth with grace.
[01:43.50]May my family see Christ living
[01:50.20]Every time they see my face.

[02:02.20]When the days are filled with laughter,
[02:08.20]Or the nights are filled with tears,
[02:14.70]Help me love with quiet faithfulness
[02:20.80]Through the seasons and the years.
[02:26.50]When I'm wrong, Lord, make me humble.
[02:32.20]Give me strength to make things right.
[02:38.70]Let my pride give way to mercy.
[02:43.50]Help me walk within Your light.

[02:50.00]Love protects.
[02:54.90]Love keeps hoping.
[02:59.90]Love believes beyond today.
[03:04.20]Love keeps serving.
[03:09.00]Love keeps giving.
[03:13.50]Love will never fade away.

[03:21.00]Let my love be patient.
[03:25.20]Let my love be kind.
[03:29.10]May forgiveness lead my footsteps,
[03:33.00]Leaving bitterness behind.
[03:36.10]When my story here is finished,
[03:40.00]May this truth remain for all:
[03:45.70]That the greatest gift You gave me
[03:49.50]Was to love as You loved us all.

[03:55.50]Faith will guide me.
[03:58.60]Hope will strengthen me.
[04:01.70]But forever...
[04:04.40]Love remains.
